config GMK70_NKRO
    bool
    depends on BOARD_GMK70_WIRED && ZMK_USB
    default y
    select ZMK_HID_KEYBOARD_NKRO_EXTENDED_REPORT
    select ZMK_USB_BOOT
    help
      Native NKRO and USB boot fallback, with a Studio-assignable toggle.
      Disabled mode limits reports to six ordinary keys without changing
      the report descriptor. Studio builds remember the mode using the
      existing gated settings backend; other profiles are runtime-only.
